### GET request to get an order
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{order1}}

### Get all restaurants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants

### Get a specific restaurant by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/{{restaurant1}}

### Get the public menu of a restaurant
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/{{restaurant1}}/menu

### Get a specific dish from a restaurant
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/{{restaurant1}}/menu/{{restaurant1_dish1}}

### Open an new order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{restaurant1}}"
}

### Place an order (adding mutiple orders of the same acts weird, does not work yet.)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/f59f4fb2-fb6a-4a1d-9232-a6da1a44f4f2/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2,
  "dishId": "{{restaurant1_dish1}}"
}